        "excerpt":"To use the ServiceNow source connector, complete the following high-level steps:       Ensure that you have the required API access and credentials to enable the streaming of ServiceNow object events.         Install the Connectivity Pack as part of your Kafka Connect deployment.         Create a KafkaConnect custom resource to define your Kafka Connect runtime and include the configuration, certificates, and connectors for the Connectivity Pack installed.         Apply the configured KafkaConnect custom resource to start the Kafka Connect runtime and verify that the connector is available for use.         Create a KafkaConnector custom resource to define your connector configuration.         Apply the configured KafkaConnector custom resource to start the connector and verify that the connector is running.   For detailed instructions and configuration options, see the Connectivity Pack connector documentation. ","categories": ["source"],
